(text "CODEC 1: acquisition channels 1 and 2, alarm speaker" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 13.208 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2cec5626-3794-547b-a7fd-9da7e4b2678c"))
(text "Inputs are AC coupled into the PGA (differential or\nsingle ended). Fit the 2k2 only for sources that need bias." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "306b0c95-af22-5a73-b9bd-5badb7249dd4"))
(text "8 ohm speaker, bridge-tied between LSPKOUT and RSPKOUT\n(right channel inverted by register), supply 5V_SW." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 134.62 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1441a130-31db-5da6-8e68-0dc57ebbb7d0"))
(text "CODEC 2: acquisition channels 3 and 4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 212.09 13.208 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e7ba18b4-995a-5f9d-b592-abd6794b68a0"))
(text "Inputs are AC coupled into the PGA (differential or\nsingle ended). Fit the 2k2 only for sources that need bias." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215.9 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "74767d85-77bf-583c-8d03-fecac175fc47"))
(text "Notes\n1. The NAU88C22 has a fixed I2C address (0x1A), so each CODEC has its own I2C bus; MODE low selects 2-wire control.\n2. The FPGA (application domain) is the I2S master and generates MCLK for each CODEC.\n3. Samples are plaintext on I2S; that is accepted inside the sealed enclosure (doc/acquisition.md).\n4. One ground net in the schematic; keep analog returns (VSSA, VREF, MICBIAS, input connector) together in layout.\n5. Unused outputs (headphone, AUXOUT) and LLIN/RLIN are left open and should be disabled in the registers.\n6. CODEC 2 has no speaker: its VDDSPK is tied to its VDDA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "feca451e-f131-5307-8fe9-e295f9fe01f7"))
